        <head>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>ILE appearance of that unique little " Diary and Corn- '. panion," Issued by GB O.G.BUSSNY CO.. for the WSJ of Cricketers (which mar be obtained from sports Dealers. Bookselters, or Railway Bookstalls to 6d.), reminds us of the crining season, in anticipation of which Guo. G. BUSSEY 8; Co., have prepared a" re ,ord " stock of Bats. We are told test the timber they hold for Bat msking alone, exceeds 1,030 tons. "Glorious Cricket follows the British Flag everywhere." Advt. (I)</p>
