        <p>Authors of letters intended for publication must in all cases send their names and addreses to the EJdor. Bfatters intended for publication must b 3 written Oil one side only of the paper. Correspondents are strongly advised to write briefly. A short letter has much greater chance of insertion than a long.one.</p>
